<title>USA: AmVestors Q1 net down.</title>
<headline>AmVestors Q1 net down.</headline>
<dateline>TOPEKA, Kan. 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.40		    $0.71</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$0.37		    $0.71</p>
<p> Net			  5,005		    7,421</p>
<p> Revs			57,594		   42,075</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	13,750		   10,427</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	17,549		   10,493</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 primary includes net investment gains of $0.01 a share and net interest expense of $0.07 a share, compared to net investment gain of $0.33 a share and net interest expense of $0.01 a share a year ago.</p>
<p>1997 diluted includes net investment gain of $0.01 a share and no net interest expense, compared to net investment gain of $0.33 a share and net interest expense of $0.01 a share.</p>
<p>Net core operating earnings, diluted, were $0.36 a share in the quarter, compared to $0.39 a share a year ago.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
